 "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the formula, we take the alternating sum of the entries in the top row of the matrix, multiplied by their respective minors, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 6 & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}| & =1|\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{aligned}|-(-2)|\\begin{aligned}4 & 5 \\\\ 6 & 2\\end{aligned}|+0|\\begin{aligned}4 & 3 \\\\ 6 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1(3\\cdot 2-5\\cdot (-1))+2(4\\cdot 2-5\\cdot 6)+0 \\\\  & =1(6+5)+2(8-30) \\\\  & =11+2(-22) \\\\  & =11-44 \\\\  & =-33\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039569/state.json" "file_sha256" "633ec702744d2bd730aaa9f0b095dbbad880853847cd2b1d5c4850ecf052df51"} {"question" "q-280394" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039569/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "9baffd44875b5a849fdb95dc21f8df6622eeea1f939b9623a8eeea5e94747cc6"} {"question" "q-280394" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039569/state.json" "file_sha256" "633ec702744d2bd730aaa9f0b095dbbad880853847cd2b1d5c4850ecf052df51"} {"question" "q-280394" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-33"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039569/state.json" "file_sha256" "633ec702744d2bd730aaa9f0b095dbbad880853847cd2b1d5c4850ecf052df51"} {"question" "q-280390" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If $A=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{aligned}],$ then $det(A)=${{fiel